      "notes": "Maximum ratings (VCEO 40 V, IC 600 mA, PD 625 mW); hFE at 0.1, 1, 10, 150 and 500 mA (100 to 300 at 150 mA, 10 V); VCE(sat) 0.3 V and VBE(sat) 0.6 to 1.2 V at 150 mA, 15 mA; TO-92 case 29 style 17 (C1, B2, E3); the ordering information."
    }
  },
  "evidence": [
    "\\(IC = 0\\.1 mAdc, VCE = 10 Vdc\\) 35 − \\(IC = 1\\.0 mAdc, VCE = 10 Vdc\\) 50 − \\(IC = 10 mAdc, VCE = 10 Vdc\\) 75 −",
