      "electrical": {
        "claims": "Ebers-Moll transistor at a constant gain of 173 (the geometric middle of the datasheet's 100 to 300 at 150 mA), collector and emitter resistances for its saturation; fixtures for hFE at the datasheet's currents (read through a collector resistor), VCE(sat) and VBE(sat).",
        "omissions": [
          "the gain's variation with current: it stays 173",
          "the Early effect: the collector current does not rise with VCE",
          "capacitances and fT, so no switching times",
          "temperature: VBE's -2 mV/C and the gain's rise",
          "second breakdown, the safe operating area and damage past the ratings",
